  <h1>Qwen vs. TotalRecalls</h1>
  <p>Qwen Chat (chat.qwen.ai) does not provide a built-in data export. TotalRecalls reads your active browser session and converts it to portable Markdown and JSON.</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Official export:</strong> Not available on the consumer chat product.</li>
    <li><strong>TotalRecalls:</strong> Markdown + JSON with full transcripts, exported from your own browser session.</li>
  </ul>
